@startuml
title Clases y contrato de estrategias
class "Catalog::Navigation" as Navigation {
  - query
  - category_id
  - page
  + call(): Result
}
interface "SearchStrategy\n(contrato conceptual)" as Strategy {
  + call(scope, query): Relation
}
class "Catalog::NameStrategy" as Name {
  + call(scope, query): Relation
}
class "Catalog::CodeStrategy" as Code {
  + call(scope, query): Relation
}
class "Result" as Result {
  products
  page
  has_more
  strategy
}
Navigation --> Strategy : selecciona y utiliza
Name ..|> Strategy
Code ..|> Strategy
Navigation ..> Result : devuelve
note right of Strategy
  Duck typing en Ruby.
  No se implementa una clase base.
end note
@enduml
